{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"b1-practice-19","level":"B1","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"Essen und Trinken 4","bn":"খাবার ও পানীয় ৪"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„abnehmen“ মানে কী?","options":["ওজন বাড়ানো","খরচ করা","ওজন কমানো"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-19-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„zunehmen“ মানে কী?","options":["ওজন বাড়ানো","ওজন কমানো","বেছে নেওয়া"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-19-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„empfehlen“ মানে কী?","options":["ধারণ করা","সুপারিশ করা","চেষ্টা করা"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-19-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Können Sie mir ein Gericht ___? (সুপারিশ করা)","options":["enthalten","ausgeben","empfehlen"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-19-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich möchte den Kuchen ___. (স্বাদ নেওয়া)","options":["probieren","abnehmen","wählen"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-19-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich muss auf meine Ernährung ___. (মনোযোগ দেওয়া)","options":["verwenden","achten","träumen"],"answer":1,"explanation":"achten auf + Akkusativ।","id":"b1-practice-19-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„ausgeben“ মানে কী?","options":["ফেরত দেওয়া","বন্ধ করা","খরচ করা"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-19-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich will mit dem Rauchen ___. (বন্ধ করা)","options":["aufhören","aussuchen","zunehmen"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-19-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"___ Sie mir bitte helfen? (ভদ্র অনুরোধ)","options":["Konnten","Könnten","Können"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Könnten Können-এর চেয়ে বেশি ভদ্র।","id":"b1-practice-19-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich ___ gern ein Wasser. (ভদ্রভাবে চাওয়া)","options":["habe","hatte","hätte"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-19-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"___ Sie kurz Zeit?","options":["Hätten","Hatten","Haben"],"answer":0,"explanation":"ভদ্র প্রশ্ন: Hätten Sie …?","id":"b1-practice-19-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wenn ich nicht so müde ___, würde ich kochen.","options":["war","wäre","bin"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-19-q12"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Das ist die Fr